{"symbol":"GTIL","yahoo":"GTIL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Gabion Technologies India Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://www.gabionindia.com","about":"Gabion Technologies India Limited engages in the manufacturing of gabions, rockfall protection netting, and geosynthetic materials in India. The company provides PVD, PVC drainage pipe, chainlink mesh, weldmesh, geocell, fabric form mattress, 3D PP geomat, GHS \u0096 high strength flexible geogrids, defence gabion, sloping fascia units, gabion box, revet mattress, DT mesh netting, sack gabions, tailmesh gabion fascia units, PP rope gabion box, Hi-tensile rockfall protection netting, 3D Geo-composite reinforced geomat, geotextiles and geo bags, HDPE Geomembrane, PET geogrid, GX jute geotextile, 3D geo-composite drain sheet, 3D concrete geo mat, and steel anchors. It also offers gabion gravity wall, GX earth wall, anchored gabion fascia wall, slope stabilization, rockfall protaction, river training and erosion control, bioengineering for erosion control, and other services. The company caters to civil engineering, infrastructure development, and environmental protection projects for a wide range of sectors including infrastructure projects, such as roads, railways, airports, irrigation and water resources sectors, energy, mining, defence, real estate developments, resorts, commercial building complexes, and IIT's for various applications. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in New Delhi, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:47:15+00:00","quote":{"price":129.2,"prevClose":136.0,"marketCap":175.39,"high52":149.9,"low52":43.52,"pe":21.64,"bookValue":41.87,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":20.46,"shares":1.3575,"insiders":67.0,"institutions":13.28},"prices":{"dates":["2026-01-13","2026-01-14","2026-01-16","2026-01-19","2026-01-20","2026-01-21","2026-01-22","2026-01-23","2026-01-27","2026-01-28","2026-01-29","2026-01-30","2026-02-02","2026-02-03","2